Notes:
- TCS-style anomalies (source ROE far below computed) are treated as VERSION_DIFFERENCE:
  companies.xlsx values appear to be a snapshot from a different reporting date than
  our latest fiscal year row. The ratio engine's computed value is used for all
  downstream analytics; the source value is display-only per the project spec.
- Cases with |computed value| > 200% (e.g. BEL, HAL) are DATA_SOURCE_ISSUE: the
  underlying balancesheet.xlsx equity_capital/reserves values for these companies
  are implausibly small relative to their net profit, which inflates the ratio.
  These are flagged for manual data correction, not treated as a formula bug.